# OctoFit Tracker - Frontend Environment Variables

# REQUIRED: Codespace name for API URL construction
# This is used to build the API base URL when running in GitHub Codespaces
# Example: https://my-codespace-name-8000.app.github.dev/api
#
# To set this up:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local: cp .env.local.example .env.local
# 2. Replace YOUR_CODESPACE_NAME with your actual Codespace name
# 3. You can find your Codespace name in the GitHub UI or by running:
#    echo $CODESPACE_NAME
#
# For local development (without Codespaces), leave this unset or comment it out
# The app will fall back to http://localhost:8000/api

VITE_CODESPACE_NAME=YOUR_CODESPACE_NAME
